      "width": 1510,
      "height": 85,
      "fontSize": 20,
      "strokeColor": "#64748b",
      "text": "Durable record: command ID, payload hash, provider/key, lease generation, attempt count, nextAttemptAt,\nerror class, provider IDs, evidence references, posting state and reconciliation state.\nDemo proof: response lost → worker restart → same-key recovery → one transfer, one posting, one reconciled debit.",
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Durable record: command ID, payload hash, provider/key, lease generation, attempt count, nextAttemptAt,\nerror class, provider IDs, evidence references, posting state and reconciliation state.\nDemo proof: response lost → worker restart → same-key recovery → one transfer, one posting, one reconciled debit.",
